      <div class="pf-faq">
        <details class="pf-faq-item"><summary><span class="pf-faq-tag pf-tag-orange">COST</span>&nbsp; How much does an emergency plumber cost in Liverpool city centre?</summary><div class="pf-faq-body"><p>£80 an hour weekdays 9am to 5pm. £120 an hour weekends 9am to 1pm. £150 an hour out of hours, nights and bank holidays. 1 hour minimum on every call-out. Parts at cost. Most jobs cost £80 to £350 total. Same fixed rates for commercial. Written quote before work starts.</p></div></details>
        <details class="pf-faq-item"><summary><span class="pf-faq-tag pf-tag-navy">RESPONSE</span>&nbsp; How quickly can you reach Liverpool city centre?</summary><div class="pf-faq-body"><p>30 minute response guaranteed across L1, L2 and L3. Out of hours when traffic clears, typical arrival is 20 to 25 minutes from our Kirkby base. A real person answers the phone any time of day or night.</p></div></details>
        <details class="pf-faq-item"><summary><span class="pf-faq-tag pf-tag-orange">COMMERCIAL</span>&nbsp; Do you cover commercial premises in the city centre?</summary><div class="pf-faq-body"><p>Yes. Bars, restaurants, hotels, offices, salons, gyms, shops. Same fixed rates as residential. £80 weekdays, £120 weekends, £150 out of hours. No commercial premium. No separate call-out fee. We work with kitchen managers, hotel duty managers and bar owners to fix faults fast so trading can continue.</p></div></details>
        <details class="pf-faq-item"><summary><span class="pf-faq-tag pf-tag-navy">AIRBNB</span>&nbsp; Do you cover Airbnb and short-let properties?</summary><div class="pf-faq-body"><p>Yes. We work with Airbnb hosts and short-let managers across the city centre. We handle emergencies between guest changeovers and provide written reports for host insurance claims. Same fixed rates. We can usually attend within the 30-minute window even on a turnover day.</p></div></details>
        <details class="pf-faq-item"><summary><span class="pf-faq-tag pf-tag-orange">STUDENTS</span>&nbsp; Do you handle student accommodation in the city centre?</summary><div class="pf-faq-body"><p>Yes. We cover student blocks across L1 and L3. Mount Pleasant, Marybone, Bold Street, Renshaw Street. We carry out CP12 gas safety certificates ahead of each academic year in July and August. Multi-room HMOs and shared student houses are familiar work for us.</p></div></details>
        <details class="pf-faq-item"><summary><span class="pf-faq-tag pf-tag-navy">BLOCKS</span>&nbsp; Can you coordinate with building management?</summary><div class="pf-faq-body"><p>Yes. Most city centre apartment blocks have a concierge or managing agent. We're used to liaising with building management to access communal risers, isolate floor-level water supplies and turn off booster pumps when needed. Bring us the management contact number if you have it. If you don't, we'll find it.</p></div></details>
        <details class="pf-faq-item"><summary><span class="pf-faq-tag pf-tag-green">GAS SAFE</span>&nbsp; Are your engineers Gas Safe registered?</summary><div class="pf-faq-body"><p>Yes. All gas work is carried out by our Gas Safe registered engineers. Verify our registration at <a href="https://www.gassaferegister.co.uk" target="_blank" rel="noopener">gassaferegister.co.uk</a>. We provide CP12 certificates for residential, HMO and commercial gas work.</p></div></details>
        <details class="pf-faq-item"><summary><span class="pf-faq-tag pf-tag-orange">GUARANTEE</span>&nbsp; Do you guarantee your work?</summary><div class="pf-faq-body"><p>Yes. Every job carries a 12-month workmanship guarantee. If something we fixed fails because of our work, we come back. No charge.</p></div></details>
